== Geometric Optics

#entry($n_1 sin theta_1 = n_2 sin theta_2 quad frac(1,f) = frac(1,d_o) + frac(1,d_i) quad m = -frac(d_i,d_o)$, note: [
    $n = c\/v$. Denser medium → toward normal. TIR: $sin theta_c = n_2\/n_1$ ($n_1 > n_2$). \
